{
  "title": "tea-pyramid",
  "sectionCount": 143,
  "html": "<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-la\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-ta wx-ta-author\">作者：Mote莫特</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pi\" style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><div data-img-ph=\"1\" style=\"width: 96%; margin: 0px auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(232, 237, 245), rgb(213, 222, 236)); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: rgb(154, 168, 190); font-size: 13px;\">配图 1</div></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pc wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-tc\">Tea Forté的金字塔茶包</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">这是我茶叶系列第9篇。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">如果要我评选全世界最好看的茶叶包装设计，那我现在毫不犹豫选择</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t wx-bold\">Tea Forté</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">我在英国</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><a class=\"wx-a\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/US1JYCoxRt-3WRgchINBDQ\">PG Tips</a></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">那篇文章的预告：PG Tips曾经凭金字塔茶包封神，美国有一个茶叶品牌叫</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t wx-bold\">Tea Forté</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">，用一座更加精致的</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t wx-bold\">金字塔茶包</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">把自己卖成了奢侈品。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">有很多文章写过它，有人称它为茶叶界的“香奈儿”、“爱马仕”、还有形容它是“兰博基尼”。“兰博基尼”是美国新闻杂志Newsweek给它的称号，这个标签Tea Forté自己乐意接受了，骄傲地挂在了自己的官网上。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">但我觉得这些都不太准确，老牌奢侈品往往太老派贵族气息了，兰博基尼又太张扬。</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t wx-bold\">Tea Forté</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">的金字塔，有着像苹果一样的高端、时尚与年轻的气质。这在整体一股“土气”的茶叶界里是难得的一股清流。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">据商业数据平台RocketReach与Datanyze估算，Tea Forté目前年营收约1540万美元（约1.1亿人民币），员工约84人。2011年被Sara Lee收购时的营收是1200万美元，14年过去涨到了1540万美元左右，增长不算快。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">但它值得讲，它是一个“设计师”改造传统的“茶”行业的故事。同时，它的渠道也是独特的，它成为了四季酒店、丽思卡尔顿等全球顶级奢华酒店与高端水疗中心的标配，在大众品牌常年把单包茶的价格压在几美分的同时，Tea Forté 却能把一盒茶卖到30美元到55美元。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">它的设计，确实是非常棒的，我把它Facebook上的照片都翻了个遍，保存了100多张好看的图。我期待茶叶界里有更多美好的设计，好设计，会给人带来好心情。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">我们先了解下，是一个怎样的人，忍不了“动手”的。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-th\">一个设计师“动手”了</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pi\" style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><div data-img-ph=\"1\" style=\"width: 96%; margin: 0px auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(232, 237, 245), rgb(213, 222, 236)); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: rgb(154, 168, 190); font-size: 13px;\">配图 2</div></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pc wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-tc\">Tea Forte的创始人Peter Hewitt（彼得·休伊特）</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">一个挑剔的设计师，可能看大多数产品都不顺眼，有时候可能忍不住会“动手”。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">Peter Hewitt（彼得·休伊特）就是这样的人。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">他毕业于罗德岛设计学院，学的是工业设计。小时候他有阅读障碍，读书很吃力，原本一度想选择法律、工程这类看上去更“正经”的职业。直到他在《时代》杂志上读到一篇关于意大利工业设计师的文章，才突然意识到：原来还有一种职业，是专门把世界上的东西重新设计一遍。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">进入RISD之后，这是他第一次在学校里觉得得心应手。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">毕业后，Hewitt在纽约一家设计咨询公司工作，设计过香水瓶、化妆品包装、缝纫机。办公室在大楼顶层，窗户正对帝国大厦。帝国大厦的灯半夜熄灭，他们经常还在加班。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">后来他辞职，一个人在公寓里做产品。他用美工刀和硬纸板做了一套国际象棋纸艺摆件，拿着样品到处推销。6个月后，这套象棋登上了MoMA（纽约现代艺术博物馆）产品目录的封面。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">之后，他又为MoMA设计了一款极简花瓶。设计非常简单：一小块大理石，中间凿出凹槽盛水，再用一根金属丝固定花茎。花插上去之后，花瓶几乎消失了，只剩下一朵花漂浮在桌面上。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">美国本地供应商报价，大理石配件就要45美元。Hewitt买了一台传真机，把图纸发给中国台湾的供应商。第二天早上，报价回来了：1.18美元。最后，这款花瓶零售价25美元，在MoMA卖了20多年。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">这段经历让Hewitt彻底搞明白了怎么用全球供应链把一个设计师的想法变成消费者买得起的产品。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">直到一次亚洲之旅，他第一次认真接触到茶。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">Hewitt第一次见识到了饮茶仪式的精致。尤其是日本茶道给了他巨大的冲击，器皿是精致的，动作是优雅的，茶叶在水中舒展的过程本身就是一种视觉享受。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">然后他回到了美国。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">美国袋泡茶给他的感觉，几乎是另一个世界。纸盒粗糙，茶包扁平，里面装着碎末，白色棉线软塌塌地拴着纸标签，有时还用订书钉固定。热水一冲，茶包变成一团灰灰的纸浆状物体，湿线滑进杯子里，拎出来还要在杯碟边滴水。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">那一刻，一个工业设计师的职业病发作了。他看到的不是“茶不好喝”这么简单，而是：这个产品从结构、材料、姿态到交互方式，都太不体面了，</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t wx-bold\">茶毫无尊严</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">而同一时期，星巴克已经把咖啡做成了一门体验生意。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">他说：我对茶一无所知，但我看到了一个完全空白的高端市场。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">2003年，他在马萨诸塞州创立了Tea Forté。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-th\">一座金字塔和一片小叶子：让茶包“站起来”</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pi\" style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><div data-img-ph=\"1\" style=\"width: 96%; margin: 0px auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(232, 237, 245), rgb(213, 222, 236)); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: rgb(154, 168, 190); font-size: 13px;\">配图 3</div></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pc\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-tc\">Tea Forté与纽约植物园联名的FLEUR系列</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-pc wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-tc\">Tea Forté金字塔茶包泡在茶杯里，茶包站立着</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">Hewitt觉得问题出在物理结构：茶包是躺着的，一泡水就失去所有形状。</span></span></section>\n<section class=\"wx-p wx-gap\"><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><span textstyle=\"\" class=\"wx-t\">还记得我之前写的英国茶包战争不？</span></span><span leaf=\"\" class=\"wx-leaf\"><a"
}